{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"He nods slowly. \"You are, of a good sort, despite your condition. You are welcome here, anytime.\" Kolro says as he adjusts his hat after bowing so much.","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:07:20.644000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865142479338995732","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"'Thank you. I... don't suppose you would know any possibility for how I became like this? I have no memories of before---well, dying, and even soon after I only have few.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:09:03.285000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865142909844979722","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"'I do not even remember HOW I died. Only that Redcoats were involved.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:10:02.193000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865143156923039764","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"Kolro shifts on his stiff feet and cane. \"My own memories of how I acquired this... affliction, are hazy at best. I am not sure if I was turned or brought back from the dead this way... but I do know this. The world above has rejected me... and yes, The ones in red pose as much a danger to us as  Sunlight.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:11:35.169000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T08:11:49.822000Z","id":"865143546893434880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"she nods grimly. 'As I suspected. I am lucky to have found friends and allies, allowing me to be more free as myself, but I still fear the day the Redcoats discover my condition. But at the same time...' she takes a deep, unneeded breath. 'I also... Feel like the horror I have become may be able to break their morale, even a little.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:13:50.495000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865144114491162664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"Kolro smiles at Sabrine's resolve. \"You have the power to enact great change... be it good or bad. Keep your friends and allies close. Protect them Sabrine, and they too will do the same.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:15:38.032000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865144565534031912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"she nods. 'I came here to find answers. I found a purpose. All I can do is fulfil it the best I can.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:16:35.857000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865144808070447115","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195531837308928","content":"'Thank you. I appreciate the talk, and it was a pleasure to have met you.'","created_at":"2021-07-15T08:16:48.682000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865144861862264843","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
